roviding innovative and high-quality\ngovernment services in an economical, fair, professional, and courteous manner to enhance and protect the\nhealth, welfare, and safety of those who live and work in Boone County.\n\n\n\n \nBoone County, Iowa\n\n 201 State St.\n\nBoone, IA 50036\n\n Contact Us\n \n\n \nCourthouse Hours\n\n Monday - Friday\n\n 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Boone County, Iowa\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeteran’s Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nBlack Friday (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve Afternoon (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \n\n\n\n"
